# The pad's menu keys: while UWindow shows its cursor A is Enter, B Escape and the D-pad the arrow keys; in play they
# are the pad's Joy keys. The run through the menus: Back opens them with the Game menu dropped down, Right twice
# goes to Options, Down to Preferences, A runs it, B closes its window (no menu is dropped down after it, so Left
# moves nothing) and Back closes the menus; the keyboard's Escape, Right, Down, Return and Left give the same states.
# Start a map, e.g. 'DM-Deck16][?Game=Botpack.DeathMatchPlus'.
waitlog up for play
sleep 3
pad attach
sleep 1
pad button a 1
pad button a 0
pad button b 1
pad button b 0
pad button dpup 1
pad button dpup 0
sleep 0.5
probe play
# The cursor out of the menus' way, then Back opens them with the Game menu dropped down.
mouse 400 400
sleep 0.2
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 1
probe pad-menu
pad button dpright 1
pad button dpright 0
sleep 0.3
probe pad-right-1
pad button dpright 1
pad button dpright 0
sleep 0.3
probe pad-right-2
pad button dpdown 1
pad button dpdown 0
sleep 0.3
probe pad-down
pad button a 1
pad button a 0
sleep 1
probe pad-a
pad button b 1
pad button b 0
sleep 0.5
probe pad-b
pad button dpleft 1
pad button dpleft 0
sleep 0.3
probe pad-left
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 1
probe pad-closed
